(Java is a high\055level\054 class\055based\054 object\055oriented programming language that is designed to have as few implementation dependencies as possible\056 It was originally developed by Sun Microsystems and released in 1995\056 Java applications are typically compiled to bytecode that can run on any Java Virtual Machine \050JVM\051 regardless of the underlying computer architecture\056) Tj
